      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it OK to compile all modules as a fragment program? IIRC we don\u0027t explicitly reject constructs like `sk_ThreadPosition` (which only makes sense in a compute shader) in vertex/fragment programs until we reach the codegen backends, so I\u0027m guessing this is OK.\n\nIt might make sense to add a comment here to that end. Alternately we may want to come up with a plan to compile a module with the appropriate program kind (maybe based on file extensions in the future) if my assumption above is wrong.",
